{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Variants"}],"symbolKind":"struct","extendedModule":"IvorModel","externalID":"s:9IvorModel8TemplateV15AnalysisOptionsV8VariantsV","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"IvorModel"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Variants"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Template.AnalysisOptions.Variants"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template\/AnalysisOptions-swift.struct"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Variants"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/UsingIvorModel"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The variants are every combination of the choices: each transposition (and none), inverted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or not, in retrograde or not, and at each time factor (and ×1). The original is always one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of them. For example, 11 transpositions with inversion and retrograde give the 48 forms of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a tone row.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each variant is made from the part’s note table, after the timing tolerance: inverted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"around the part’s own pitch range, then transposed, then reversed within the part’s own time","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"range, then scaled in time from the part’s start. It is then sliced into note events like the","type":"text"},{